        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium chloride, powder, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium chloride, powder, at plant
na;
CAS number: 007647-14-5; 
Formula: NaCl; 
Synonyms: Steinsalz, salt, Salz; 
UUID: 44622f5f-43cb-318f-8892-1c4b6e27b502
this module includes the solution mining process of sodium chloride, its cleaning form impurities, and the drying step. It is sold as bulk and therefore no packaging materials are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: modern solution mining technology (thermo compressing technology)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: ca. 40 Mio. t
Sampling: questionnaire from one European solution mining site 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_44622f5f-43cb-318f-8892-1c4b6e27b502.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
